[0.492052, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m» Find rasdaemon's build in hyperscale10s-packages-main and the tags it is in\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[90m$\u001b[0m \u001b[1m\u001b[32mkoji --profile cbs list-tagged --latest hyperscale10s-packages-main-candidate rasdaemon\u001b[0m\r\n"]
