[1.159763, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m» Find the tracking issue to update, through GitLab's API\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.492915, "o", "\r\nChecked rasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs.el10 against rasdaemon-0.8.4-1.hs.el10, the newest in -release, in CentOS Stream 10, EPEL 10 and hyperscale10s-packages-main-release.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mAnalysis\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n- Changed Provides: 4 (4 updated, 0 removed)\r\n- Installability issues: 0\r\n\r\n\u001b[32mNo breakage expected.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nChanges 4 Provides to another version:\r\n\r\n- config(rasdaemon) = 0.8.4-1.hs.el10 to config(rasdaemon) = 1.0.0-2.hs.el10\r\n- rasdaemon = 0.8.4-1.hs.el10 to rasdaemon = 1.0.0-2.hs.el10\r\n- rasdaemon(aarch-64) = 0.8.4-1.hs.el10 to rasdaemon(aarch-64) = 1.0.0-2.hs.el10\r\n- rasdaemon(x86-64) = 0.8.4-1.hs.el10 to rasdaemon(x86-64) = 1.0.0-2.hs.el10\r\n\r\n\r\nChecked rasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10 against rasdaemon-0.8.3-1.1.hs+fb.el10, the newest in -release, in CentOS Stream 10, EPEL 10 and hyperscale10s-packages-facebook-release.\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mAnalysis\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n- Changed Provides: 4 (4 updated, 0 removed)\r\n- Installability issues: 0\r\n\r\n\u001b[32mNo breakage expected.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nChanges 4 Provides to another version:\r\n\r\n- config(rasdaemon) = 0.8.3-1.1.hs+fb.el10 to config(rasdaemon) = 1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10\r\n- rasdaemon = 0.8.3-1.1.hs+fb.el10 to rasdaemon = 1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10\r\n- rasdaemon(aarch-64) = 0.8.3-1.1.hs+fb.el10 to rasdaemon(aarch-64) = 1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10\r\n- rasdaemon(x86-64) = 0.8.3-1.1.hs+fb.el10 to rasdaemon(x86-64) = 1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mrasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs.el10 to -testing:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[32mcbs tag-build hyperscale10s-packages-main-testing rasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs.el10\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1mrasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10 to -testing:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[32mcbs tag-build hyperscale10s-packages-facebook-testing rasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1mThen comment on https://gitlab.com/CentOS/Hyperscale/rpms/rasdaemon/-/work_items/1:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m `rasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs.el10` is ready for testing: tagged into `hyperscale10s-packages-main-testing`.\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m \r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m Tested it? React to this comment with 👍 if it works or 👎 if it does not, and comment on what broke.\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m \r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m (the check against `rasdaemon-0.8.4-1.hs.el10` shown above, with every version change listed; `--dry-run` shows the comment in full)\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m \r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m <sub>Checked by cbspkg 0.28.2: `cbspkg promote --variant main --variant facebook`</sub>\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m \r\n  \u001b[90m> <!-- sandogasa: rasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs.el10 reached testing -->\u001b[0m\r\n  and label it stage::testing\r\n\u001b[1mThen comment on https://gitlab.com/CentOS/Hyperscale/rpms/rasdaemon/-/work_items/1:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.6e-05, "o", "  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m `rasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10` is ready for testing: tagged into `hyperscale10s-packages-facebook-testing`.\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m \r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m Tested it? React to this comment with 👍 if it works or 👎 if it does not, and comment on what broke.\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m \r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m (the check against `rasdaemon-0.8.3-1.1.hs+fb.el10` shown above, with every version change listed; `--dry-run` shows the comment in full)\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m \r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m <sub>Checked by cbspkg 0.28.2: `cbspkg promote --variant main --variant facebook`</sub>\r\n  \u001b[90m>\u001b[0m \r\n  \u001b[90m> <!-- sandogasa: rasdaemon-1.0.0-2.hs+fb.el10 reached testing -->\u001b[0m\r\n  and label it stage::testing\r\n\u001b[1mThen, asked separately, the older builds they replace:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[32mcbs untag-build hyperscale10s-packages-main-testing rasdaemon-1.0.0-1.hs.el10\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[32mcbs untag-build hyperscale10s-packages-facebook-testing rasdaemon-1.0.0-1.hs+fb.el10\u001b[0m\r\nPromote? [Y/n]: "]
